kmap 1
id us-workman-intl
layout us
variant workman-intl
name English (Workman, intl., with dead keys)
level3 ralt
key TLDE dead_grave dead_tilde ` ~
key AE01 1 ! ¡ ¹
key AE02 2 @ ² dead_doubleacute
key AE03 3 '#' ³ dead_macron
key AE04 4 $ ¤ £
key AE05 5 % € dead_cedilla
key AE06 6 dead_circumflex ¼ ^
key AE07 7 & ½ dead_horn
key AE08 8 * ¾ dead_ogonek
key AE09 9 ( ‘ dead_breve
key AE10 0 ) ’ dead_abovering
key AE11 - _ ¥ dead_belowdot
key AE12 = + × ÷
key AD01 q Q ä Ä caps
key AD02 d D ð Ð caps
key AD03 r R ® ™ caps
key AD04 w W å Å caps
key AD05 b B b B caps
key AD06 j J ï Ï caps
key AD07 f F ë Ë caps
key AD08 u U ú Ú caps
key AD09 p P ö Ö caps
key AD10 ; : ¶ °
key AD11 [ { « “
key AD12 ] } » ”
key BKSL \ | ¬ ¦
key AC01 a A á Á caps
key AC02 s S ß § caps
key AC03 h H h H caps
key AC04 t T þ Þ caps
key AC05 g G g G caps
key AC06 y Y ü Ü caps
key AC07 n N ñ Ñ caps
key AC08 e E é É caps
key AC09 o O ó Ó caps
key AC10 i I í Í caps
key AC11 dead_acute dead_diaeresis '''' "
key LSGT \ | \ |
key AB01 z Z æ Æ caps
key AB02 x X · dead_stroke caps
key AB03 m M µ ± caps
key AB04 c C © ¢ caps
key AB05 v V v V caps
key AB06 k K œ Œ caps
key AB07 l L ø Ø caps
key AB08 , < ç Ç
key AB09 . > dead_abovedot dead_caron
key AB10 / ? ¿ dead_hook
key SPCE space
key KPDL KP_Delete KP_Decimal
key CAPS BackSpace Escape BackSpace BackSpace
